  "title": {
   "en": "Mafia no Akuyaku Reijou desu ga Oshi ga Watashi o Koroshi ni Yattekimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "マフィアの悪役令嬢ですが推しがわたしを殺しにやってきます"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"I am addicted to Ryu Yang, my favorite character in the otome game 'Secret Noir'.\" Yang is a character in the game that you cannot win the heart of no matter what, an unromanceable character. The next moment after she faints in an accident in the real world, she is there in the game. \"Have I been reincarnated?\" And she has turned into a mafia villainess, Xiaolu, of all people. Xiaolu is killed by Yang in the game."
  },
